        "original_id": "a5efc9fb-b601-5537-9127-fee0aba5aec1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yvan Rodic, FaceHunter\n- Companies: Esprit Holdings, Armani, Esprit, Volvo\n- Places: Kowloon, Hong Kong, Ratingen, Düsseldorf, Germany\n- Roles: street style photographer\n- Topics: cultural events, fashion events\n\nFacts:\n- In February 2006, Yvan Rodic began posting his street style photography results online.\n- Yvan Rodic, also known as FaceHunter, is a Swiss street style photographer who travels the world photographing people at cultural events and fashion events.\n- Since February 2006, Yvan Rodic has contributed to brands including Armani, Esprit, and Volvo.\n- Esprit Holdings is headquartered in Kowloon, Hong Kong, and in Ratingen near Düsseldorf, Germany.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
