        "text": "Page: Yvan Rodic. Sentence: Yvan Rodic also known as \"FaceHunter\", is a Swiss street style-photographer who travels the world photographing people at cultural events and fashion events.\nPage: Yvan Rodic. Sentence: In February 2006, he began posting the results online and since then he's contributed to brands like Armani, Esprit and Volvo.\nPage: Esprit Holdings. Sentence: The company is headquartered in Kowloon, Hong Kong, and Ratingen (near Düsseldorf), Germany.",
